## Component Documentation

### ProtocolOverview
The main container component for the protocol overview.

Props:
- `name`: string - The protocol name
- `type`: string - The protocol type
- `description`: string - A comprehensive description of the protocol

### ProtocolSection
Represents a major section of the protocol overview.

Props:
- `title`: string - The section title
- `type`: 'participants' | 'principles' | 'mechanics' | 'governance' - The type of section
- `description`: string - A brief description of the section

### ParticipantRole
Represents a specific role in the protocol.

Props:
- `role`: string - The role name
- `type`: 'contributor' | 'developer' | 'stakeholder' - The type of role
- `importance`: 'high' | 'medium' | 'low' - The importance level
- `description`: string - A brief description of the role
- `responsibilities`: string[] - Array of role responsibilities

### DesignPrinciple
Represents a core design principle of the protocol.

Props:
- `principle`: string - The principle name
- `type`: 'mechanism' | 'standard' | 'economics' | 'governance' - The type of principle
- `importance`: 'high' | 'medium' | 'low' - The importance level
- `description`: string - A brief description of the principle
- `implementation`: string - How the principle is implemented

## Usage Example

```tsx
<ProtocolOverview
  name="Example Protocol"
  type="decentralized"
  description="Example protocol description"
>
  <ProtocolSection
    title="Example Section"
    type="participants"
    description="Example section description"
  >
    <ParticipantRole
      role="Example Role"
      type="contributor"
      importance="high"
      description="Example role description"
      responsibilities={["Example responsibility"]}
    />
  </ProtocolSection>
</ProtocolOverview>
```

## Notes
- Maintain clear separation of concerns between roles
- Document all responsibilities and requirements
- Keep principles aligned with protocol goals
- Update documentation as protocol evolves
- Include implementation details where relevant
- Document interaction between different roles
- Specify governance and decision-making processes
- Include security and compliance considerations
